   <chapter title="Overview">
       <p><b>File:</b> <code>OtherTests/SideMenu/BatchProcesses/1.Processes_test.cy.ts</code></p>
        <p><b>Folder:</b> <code>OtherTests/SideMenu/BatchProcesses</code></p>
        <p><b>Description:</b> Verifies that the first-level menu items under "Processes" can be toggled for visibility and contain more than four items.</p>
        <p><b>Priority:</b> Medium</p>
        <p><b>Owner:</b> QA Team</p>
        <p><b>Tags:</b> regression, navigation, processes</p>
